15:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-brand-ink mb-8","children":"关于 OPT 使用 TurboTax 的常见疑问"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"borderColor":"#8E9775"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#8E9775"},"children":"Q:"}]," ","我是 F-1 身份，TurboTax 默认不是给美国人用的吗？"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold","style":{"color":"#8E9775"},"children":"A:"}]," ","是的。TurboTax 默认流程是为美国税务居民（Resident Alien/Citizen）设计的。留学生（F-1/J-1）在入境前 5 个日历年通常属于“豁免个人（Exempt Individual）”，即税务上的非居民（NRA）。本工具的作用就是帮你判断你是否已经跨过了“5 年期限”或满足了“实质居住测试（SPT）”，从而确定你是否具备使用 TurboTax 的法律前提。"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"borderColor":"#A2B5BB"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#A2B5BB"},"children":"Q:"}]," ","我刚好是第 6 年，现在可以用 TurboTax 了吗？"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold","style":{"color":"#A2B5BB"},"children":"A:"}]," ","进入第 6 个日历年意味着你可能通过实质居住测试（SPT）转为税务居民（RA）。但如果你的身份仍是 F-1 且有学业计划，仍需确认是否符合特定的豁免条件。本判定工具会结合你的入境年份和当前签证状态，给出最稳妥的路径建议。"]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"borderColor":"#E28E8E"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#E28E8E"},"children":"Q:"}]," ","如果不小心用 TurboTax 报错了身份，会有什么后果？"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold","style":{"color":"#E28E8E"},"children":"A:"}]," ","最直接的影响是你会错误地领取了“标准扣除额（Standard Deduction）”。对于 NRA 来说，这属于非法欠税。这不仅会导致 IRS 追缴税款和罚金，更严重的是在未来申请 H1B 或绿卡进行背景调查时，错误的税表记录可能被视为缺乏“良好道德品质”或违反移民法规。"]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"borderColor":"#D4BEAD"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#D4BEAD"},"children":"Q:"}]," ","为什么很多人说用 TurboTax 拿到的退税更多？"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold","style":{"color":"#D4BEAD"},"children":"A:"}]," ","这是一个陷阱。退税变多通常是因为软件误把你当成居民，给了你 NRA 不该享受的税收抵免（如中美税收协定外的额度或各种 Credit）。这种“多出来的钱”本质上是 IRS 的贷款，且带有高额逾期罚息风险。"]}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"borderColor":"#94B49F"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#94B49F"},"children":"Q:"}]," ","TurboTax 里的“Resident”定义和移民局（USCIS）一样吗？"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold","style":{"color":"#94B49F"},"children":"A:"}]," ","完全不同。这是留学生最容易混淆的地方。移民局看的你的签证类型，而 IRS 只看你在美国待了多少天。你可能在移民局眼里是“Non-immigrant”，但在 IRS 眼里已经是“Resident for tax purposes”。本工具完全基于 IRS 的《Publication 519》标准进行判定。"]}]]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"borderColor":"#BB9981"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex gap-2","children":["$L1f"," ","我已经开始在 TurboTax 填了，现在发现不对还来得及吗？"]}],"$L20"]}]]}]]}]
