20:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold","style":{"color":"#BB9981"},"children":"A:"}]," ","只要还没点击最后的“Submit/E-file”，你随时可以退出。如果你已经提交且发现报错了身份，你需要提交 1040-X 表格进行修正（Amended Return）。"]}]
